# Medical NLP Rules

- Preserve original character offsets.
- Use normalized text only for matching and lookup.
- Never output codes outside the loaded dictionary.
- Never map drugs to ICD-10 or diseases to RxNorm.
- Keep negated and family-history diseases distinct from present patient conditions.
- Candidate generation must filter by entity type and code-system compatibility.
